version: "0.2.0"
date-released: 2026-09-11

abstract: >
  HeylandCircle is an open-source Python package for constructing and
  analyzing Heyland circle diagrams for three-phase induction machines.
  It supports circle construction from machine parameters and test data,
  including equivalent-circuit parameter extraction and visualization
  of induction-machine performance characteristics.

keywords:
  - induction machines
  - electrical machines
  - Heyland circle
  - circle diagram
  - equivalent circuit
  - parameter extraction
  - engineering education
  - scientific computing

